# Backend Rules

- Keep privileged Supabase operations server-side.
- Never expose service-role credentials to client code.
- Put database access in `src/services`.
- Validate all input before persistence.
- Enforce authorization server-side.
- Use Supabase Row Level Security for protected data.
- Keep external integrations behind service boundaries.
